{
  "doc": "M3-C08-02 story, in the Corrow kit's frame since M3-C08-1202 (ADR 0200; tools/act1/corrow_frame.py, migrated once by tools/act1/ch08_corrow_relayout.py). The seawall's walk is an arc (R 300 m about (0, 0, +300); the sea is +z, south) at y 12, the Watchers on its parapet; the trader comes in from the south to the mole (Mole, y 1.2), whose ramp climbs the sea face over the parapet onto the walk at s 15. The Fisher Stair climbs the wall's inner face eastward from its foot at s -40 (the low town, y 1) to its head landing at s -18..-14.5 (WallHead is beside it); Liss's hoist is at s -16.5. The low town lies north of the wall round the stair-foot lane; the Bastion (barracks, chapel, the save shrine, the chandler) is a platform at walk height west of s -58; the watch-red wall-gate to the headland and Coilspire is on the walk at s 35. Collision is corrow_collision.json (generated: the wall, kerb and parapet per 12 m segment, the town floor, the Bastion, the stair's flights as ramps, the mole), the look is corrow_dressing.json (the kit). The Breach takes the stair's middle (s -36..-24): WallSection and its parapet and kerb, the Watchers there and the stair's upper flights go; the Breach block brings the kit's breach, broken stair and fallen heads. states (Ch04Zone): the day's cast; the storm from ch08_beacon_opened; the hoist from ch08_hoist_rigged; Pell on the parapet from ch08_wave2_held; the flood and Kerrid at the stair foot from ch08_wave3_held; the figure in the storm from ch08_reach_survived; the breach, the black lake and the aftermath cast from ch08_wall_fell; the cut rope from ch08_hoist_cut_down. lights (Ch06Zone): the day is the kit's storm front (30 deg, azimuth 250), the storm (ch08_beacon_opened) the surge, the aftermath (ch08_wall_fell) the fallen grade (environment_res). start_hidden (Ch08Zone): the flood, the lake, the breach and the hoist. The set piece's four fights return to WallHead.",
